# Dart / Flutter
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
build/
coverage/

# Rust
target/

# Local data produced by tests, probes and verification runs.
#
# Unit tests keep their scratch data in the operating system's temp directory
# and clean it up themselves (`Directory.systemTemp`, `std::env::temp_dir()`),
# so a test run leaves nothing behind. The command-line tools under
# `tooling/native/checks/` write here by default instead, because their output is
# meant to be looked at: a capture, a probe log, a rendered QR. Keep them out of
# version control; anything worth keeping (a fixture, a report) is copied or
# written with an explicit `--out` into the tree on purpose.
.local/

# Editors and operating systems
.idea/
.vscode/
*.iml
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Agent/IDE client state (machine-local, never project source)
.freebuff/
.codebuddy/

# Local configuration and secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc
# Widget Preview related
.widget_preview/

# Signing material (provided locally or by Actions Secrets)
*.jks
*.keystore
*.p12
*.mobileprovision
key.properties
